-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Miklaur.png/70px-Portrait_Miklaur.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Miklaur.png/105px-Portrait_Miklaur.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Miklaur.png/140px-Portrait_Miklaur.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Portrait_Miklaur.png/70px-Portrait_Miklaur.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Portrait_Miklaur.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">I do hope you'll do as Master Lorroakan says. He's quite a brilliant man.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Miklaur</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>When the party first teleport to <a href=\"/wiki/Ramazith%27s_Tower\" title=\"Ramazith's Tower\">Ramazith's Tower</a>, Miklaur is standing still with an apple on his head, while Lorroakan commands <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Krank\" title=\"Krank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Krank.png/25px-Portrait_Krank.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Krank.png/38px-Portrait_Krank.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Krank.png/50px-Portrait_Krank.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Krank\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Portrait_Krank.png/25px-Portrait_Krank.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Portrait_Krank.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Krank\" title=\"Krank\">Krank</a> to fire an arrow into the apple. If fighting against Lorroakan, Miklaur joins him in combat despite his poor combat skills.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Note_from_Vompter\" title=\"A Note from Vompter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Note_from_Vompter\" title=\"A Note from Vompter\">A Note from Vompter</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Wizard%27